     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div name=\"messageBodySection\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Check out model ‘bym2’,  which is ``bym done right’’. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nYou can use that one in the non-gaussian case as well</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div name=\"messageSignatureSection\"><br>\r\n<div>—\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Haavard Rue</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">HelpDesk </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">help@r-inla. org</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div name=\"messageReplySection\">On 11 Dec 2023 at 21:52 +0300, Eugeni Vidal Tortosa &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">eugen...@hotmail.com</a>&gt;, wrote:<br>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\" style=\"border-left-color:grey;border-left-width:thin;border-left-style:solid;margin:5px 5px;padding-left:10px\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.1em;padding:0px;border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI Adjusted&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(12,13,14)\">I would like to know which model is most appropriate for areal data when the dependent variable is continuous (distance travelled in this case).</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.1em;padding:0px;border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI Adjusted&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(12,13,14)\">I have looked at the Besag-York-Mollié (BYM) model in the R-INLA R package, but as far as I understood the BYM models are only for Gaussian-distributed data. Am I right?</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI Adjusted&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(12,13,14)\">Thanks!</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n--<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;R-inla discussion group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">r-inla-discussion...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/r-inla-discussion-group/5c58ecb4-121e-4847-bfd5-a1a83797443fn%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/r-inla-discussion-group/5c58ecb4-121e-4847-bfd5-a1a83797443fn%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792435965039000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3F7bKBINGYyRtLuNXmGMKy\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/r-inla-discussion-group/5c58ecb4-121e-4847-bfd5-a1a83797443fn%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br></blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
